chapter.v:
In the 


third year, 


of his reign he sent his officials, Ben-hail, Obadiah, Zechariah, Nethanel, and Micaiah, to teach in the cities of Judah;

This was 


the muster, 


of them by fathers’ houses: Of Judah, the commanders of thousands: Adnah the commander, with 300,000 mighty men of valor;

and next 


to him, 


Jehohanan the commander, with 280,000;

Of Benjamin: 


Eliada, a, 


mighty man of valor, with 200,000 men armed with bow and shield;
